  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="bf32d32f-b05c-5113-8533-f34720151d7b" activityNameId="60c501af-c203-580a-bf1f-80815acd2c0e" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Soybean methyl ester, production BR, at service station</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Soybean methyl ester, production BR, at service station
Inventory refers to the distribution of 1 kg of soybean methyl ester (SME) in Switzerland. SME is imported from BR and produced from soybean oil. Distribution to the final consumer (service station) including all necessary transports.;
Formula: C19H35O2; 
Synonyms: XME, SME, biodiesel, bio-diesel; 
UUID: a9d79b01-a896-3730-89af-b19b8d3f6701
This dataset includes the transport of soybean methyl ester (SME) from esterification plants in BR to Switzerland (500 km by rail, 150 km by truck, 10000 km by tanker, 840 km by barge), and distribution to the end user (100 km by rail and 150 km by road). Operation of storage tanks and fuel station is included. Emissions from evaporation and treatment of effluents are also included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Distribution of fuels
Time period: undefined
Production volume: Production of biodiesel for use as a fuel was marginal in 2005 in BR
Sampling: Environmental reports and literature. Calculation of freight distances. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a9d79b01-a896-3730-89af-b19b8d3f6701.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
